Climbio brand artwork: the parent logo (green and blue twin holds with the climbio wordmark), the two mobile app cat characters
(Hold Cat and Redpoint Cat) and the Holdcats (綠綠, 條條, 圓圓, 尖尖 and 洞洞) character designs and artwork
Copyright (c) 2026 Kant Kang (Climbio)

Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Anyone may use, adapt, remix and use them commercially, as long as they give credit, e.g.

  Climbio logo and cat characters © Climbio | CC BY 4.0 | https://climbio.app

Scope: the source files, character sheet and motion preview in this folder (design/brand/), and the artwork derived from them
(icons in icons/brand/ and icons/cats/, the Hold Cat embedded in hold/index.html, CAST in js/holdcat.js, the shapes and moves in
js/mascot-motion.js). The code is licensed under the repo's license. See TRADEMARKS.md at the repo root for the request about
using the name and logo “Climbio” to represent an official service.

The wordmark letters are vector outlines converted from Comfortaa (SIL Open Font License 1.1); no font files are included or
distributed here.
